{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1494970-rite-of-renunciation-and-skin-dancers","id":1494970,"title":"Rite of Renunciation and Skin Dancers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-10-14T08:55:24-07:00","id":1494970,"title":"Rite of Renunciation and Skin Dancers","content":"Could a group of kinfolk be tasked with hunting down BSDs for the pelts, undergo rite of sacred rebirth, rite of cleansing and the rite of renunciation being brought over to the Garou Nations?<br /> Arguably no for flavor fluff reasons, logistically yes, but mechanically it works, right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26882-siegetroll","name":"SiegeTroll","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-15T08:13:20-07:00","id":1495016,"title":"","content":"The rite itself works. It would also work if five Garou went and sacrficed themselves for you because of X. The only problem in itself is that the rite itself is deeply tainted either way. And I can see a number of problems stemming from using the skins of corrupt and mutated werewolves as materials you need to bond to yourself.<br /> <br /> However, I don't see you being accepted by anyone after you perform the Rite of Rennaunciation. Skin Dancers are not a tribe, they are an anomaly and their corrupt spiritual makeup follows them wherever they go.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[]